---
import {BASE} from '../../lib/episodes';
const target = `${BASE}library/`;
const canonical = new URL(target, Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>学习内容 · IT小村</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
    <script is:inline define:vars={{target}}>
      window.location.replace(target + window.location.search + window.location.hash);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>学习系列与全部内容已合并。<a href={target}>前往学习内容 →</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
